  "ingredients": [
    "2 cups crushed pretzels",
    "0.75 cup butter, melted",
    "3 tablespoons white sugar",
    "1 (8 ounce) package cream cheese, softened",
    "1 cup white sugar",
    "1 (8 ounce) container frozen whipped topping, thawed",
    "2 (3 ounce) packages strawberry flavored Jell-O®",
    "2 cups boiling water",
    "2 (10 ounce) packages frozen strawberries"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients and preheat the oven to 400 degrees F (200 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/1H40FRDY7-XP2Mn199pl35tPvyQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/20338-strawberry-pretzel-salad-DDMFS-step-1-BG-31489-6a0faae52b4b4db89e60e6d3037b7b82.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/20338/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir crushed pretzels, melted butter, and 3 tablespoons sugar together until well-combined; mix well and press mixture into the bottom of a 9x13-inch baking dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/_4iDgB2siT0rdkLvX4IqehCRTNQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/20338-strawberry-pretzel-salad-DDMFS-step-2-BG-31491-91d9086c0e21415994db0b1b14f95509.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/20338/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until set, about 8 to 10 minutes; set aside to cool.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ART9lf9HQ2XGWLFvbqHNN-Rfru4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/20338-strawberry-pretzel-salad-DDMFS-step-4-BG-31515-a345283a945b43c3a4b032c01b1d7591.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/20338/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place cream cheese and 1 cup sugar in a large bowl. Beat with an electric mixer until smooth; fold in whipped topping. Spread mixture onto cooled crust.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/qbuasiQ4ltT4FXsj3kuzrSSYu3U=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/20338-strawberry-pretzel-salad-DDMFS-step-7-BG-31518-b0352a6a4e13495298608390008ee928.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/20338/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dissolve gelatin in boiling water. Stir in still-frozen strawberries and allow to set for a few minutes, until the mixture \"looks like egg whites.\" Spoon and spread over cream cheese layer; refrigerate until set, at least 2 hours.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/a0xLUG9uHJ80K6_q8-b1jT1BkTU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/20338-strawberry-pretzel-salad-DDMFS-step-10-BG-31757-a8a782ee7f404fc381669ae69df7ab3b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/20338/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/YaZ4P1r1eWE2fNabdpibcgDkuZA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/20338-strawberry-pretzel-salad-VAT-004-4x3-01-lowangle-f12c1731e71b40648af072e75354785f.jpg"
